Package: miadi-server
Version: 0.1.0
Section: web
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: bash, miadi-config (>= 0.2.0), miadi-node (>= 24.21.0-1), miadi-node (<< 25)
Suggests: systemd
Maintainer: Miadi <mia@jgwill.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/jgwill/miadi-orchestration-kit
Description: The Miadi web app as a per-user service
 The launcher and the per-user systemd unit that run the Miadi web app
 (jgwill/Miadi) from a checkout on this host. miadi-server starts it in the
 mode its mode file names and refuses a production start with no build.
 miadi-server check says what it would run and what stops it.
 .
 The checkout, its dependencies and its build stay with the checkout: this
 package installs the service, starts nothing, and is not part of miadi.
